begin="57.812" end="58.513">记得</span><span begin="58.513" end="59.205">街灯</span><span begin="59.205" end="59.923">照</span><span begin="59.923" end="1:00.493">出</span><span begin="1:00.771" end="1:01.715">一</span><span begin="1:01.715" end="1:02.268">脸</span><span begin="1:02.268" end="1:03.198">黄</span></p><p begin="1:03.346" end="1:09.405" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:03.346" end="1:03.741">还</span><span begin="1:03.741" end="1:04.225">燃</span><span begin="1:04.225" end="1:04.515">亮</span><span begin="1:04.515" end="1:05.317">那份</span><span begin="1:05.317" end="1:06.036">微</span><span begin="1:06.036" end="1:06.811">温</span><span begin="1:06.811" end="1:07.694">的</span><span begin="1:07.969" end="1:08.386">便</span><span begin="1:08.386" end="1:09.405">当</span></p><p begin="1:09.737" end="1:14.863" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:09.737" end="1:10.494">剪影</span><span begin="1:10.494" end="1:11.243">的你</span><span begin="1:11.243" end="1:11.729">轮</span><span begin="1:11.729" end="1:12.409">廓</span> <span begin="1:12.809" end="1:13.659">太</span><span begin="1:13.781" end="1:14.212">好</span><span begin="1:14.212" end="1:14.863">看</span></p><p begin="1:15.047" end="1:21.384" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:15.047" end="1:15.817">凝住</span><span begin="1:15.817" end="1:16.457">眼</span><span begin="1:16.457" end="1:17.006">泪</span><span begin="1:17.261" end="1:17.786">才</span><span begin="1:17.786" end="1:18.361">敢</span><span begin="1:18.361" end="1:19.014">细</span><span begin="1:19.014" end="1:21.384">看</span></p></div><div begin="1:23.882" end="1:47.702" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:23.882" end="1:29.688" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="voice1"><span begin="1:23.882" end="1:24.417">忘</span><span begin="1:24.417" end="1:24.748">掉</span><span begin="1:24.748" end="1:25.140">天</span><span begin="1:25.140" end="1:25.702">地</span> <span begin="1:25.890" end="1:26.612">仿佛</span><span begin="1:26.612" end="1:27.010"